  "texts": {
    "preamble": "M.A.Haris Rehman(Nominee) vs Alex K Issac on 25 May, 2015 Author: B. Kemal Pasha Bench: B.Kemal Pasha In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present: The Honourable Mr. Justice B.Kemal Pasha Tuesday, The 30Th Day Of January 2018 / 10Th Magha, 1939 Crl.MC.No. 109 of 2017 Cc.No.1398/2016 Of Judicial First Class Magistrate Court,Vaikom ---------- Petitioner(S)/Accused Nos.2 & 3: 1 M.A.Haris Rehman(Nominee), Senior Manager, Tata Global Beverages Ltd., Munnar.P.O., Pin-685 612. 2 M/S.Tata Global Beverages, Pullivasal Packeting Centre Ltd. Munnar.P.O., Pin-685 612, (Represented By Accused No.2). By Sri.P.Vijaya Bhanu,Senior Advocate Advs.Sri.M.Revikrishnan Sri.C.Jayakiran Respondent(S)/Complainant & State: 1. Alex K Issac, Food Safety Officer, Vaikom Circle, Office Of The Food Safety Officer, Ettumanoor Circle, Ettumanoor. 2. State Of Kerala, Represented By Public Prosecutor M.A.Haris Rehman(Nominee) vs Alex K Issac on 25 May, 2015 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/119512115/ 1 High Court Of Kerala, Ernakulam. R2 By Public Prosecutor Sri.Amjad Ali This Criminal Misc. Case Having Been Finally Heard On 30-01-2018, The Court On The Same Day Passed The Following: sts Crl.MC.No. 109 of 2017 () Appendix Petitioner(S)' Annexures: Annexure A True Copy Of The Complaint Preferred By The 1St Respondent Herein Before The Court Of The Judicial Magistrate Of The First Class, Vaikom, On Which Cognizance Was Taken. Annexure B True Copy Of The Form B Report Obtained In The Instant Case From The Food Analyst By The Complainant Annexure C True Copy Of The Notification Issued By The Food Safety And Standards Authority Of India Dated 25.5.2015. Annexure D True Copy Of The Manual For Analysis Of Beverages (Coffee, Tea, Cocoa, Chicory) Sugar And Sugar Products And Confectionery Products. Annexure E Chart Prepared, Giving A Comparison Of Iron Filings In Tea, Before And After Grinding Tea. Annexure F True Copy Of The Order Dated 19.5.2016 Passed By The Food Safety And Standards Authority Of India. Annexure G True Copy Of The Order Dated 02/11/2017 Passed By The Food Safety And Standard Authority Of India Respondent'S Annexures: Nil M.A.Haris Rehman(Nominee) vs Alex K Issac on 25 May, 2015",
    "facts": "As per order dated 02.11.2017 of the Director (RCD), all States and Union Territories are directed not to launch prosecutions for non-conformance of limit of iron filings in cases where samples were picked up/tested prior to 19.05.2016. In this case, prosecution has been launched for non-conformance of iron fillings in the year 2015.",
